KenseiECS test stand, module unity: mutant for Stand/unity/run.sh --selftest (lib/selftest.py).
Paths are relative to the package folder (KenseiECS/): patch -p1 -d <copy of KenseiECS> < marker-dev-define.patch

Mutant: marker-dev-define
Kind: bug
Origin: rollback of a 2.2.1 fix (a release build with a hand-written DEVELOPMENT_BUILD no longer slips through)
Expect: release-build-blocked-dev-define
